SPRACHE EN
DIALOG 10 "Set up hard disk" 0 0 236 136
  STATIC   "Hard disk"     19   8   6 140 10
  RADIO    "Disk &1"       21 150   4  40 10 AN
  RADIO    "Disk &2"       22 192   4  40 10
  LIST                     30   8  18 220 70 WS_VSCROLL
  BUTTON   "&Create..."    11   8  94  70 14
