TEXTE
  1 "Set up hard disk"
  2 "Hard disk %s"
  3 "Hard disk %s: %s MB"
  4 "Primary"
  5 "Extended"
  6 "Logical"
  7 "Free"
  8 "active"
  9 "foreign"
  10 "Size of the new drive in MB (at most %s):"
  11 "Delete drive %s?\nAll data on it will be lost."
  12 "Delete the extended partition with all logical drives?\nAll data on them will be lost."
  13 "Write the changes to the hard disk?"
  14 "The partitions have been written. DOS sees them\nonly after a restart, then format them.\nRestart now? Unsaved data in other\nprograms will be lost."
